{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "dfc2e8760ef3e654a5dd9af47e60139632bf76806036f0a6d8cc5844a210cf16", "ja": "挑戦の果て、たどり着いた場所", "zh": "挑战的尽头，抵达之所", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cc751fe2ddb07ffa970e7554fa3cf8225e756e0bdf324807f4268f4dba52071d", "ja": "試写を見た観客の反応に、確かな手応えを感\nじるメンバー。各々が作品の感想を語り合い\nながら、これからのビジョンを思い描く。\n続きは打ち上げの場で、とプロデューサーに\n促され、みんなで意気揚々と会場に向かう。", "zh": "成员们从试映观众的反应中感受到了切实的回响。大家一边互相谈论对作品的感想，一边描绘着今后的愿景。在制作人的催促下，众人决定把后续留到庆功宴上继续聊，于是一起兴致勃勃地向会场出发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e11cd837fb3bd4ad605252dc4b3e83157efc27f08b4ce0867adfe45f12ac4392", "ja": "試写会終了後……", "zh": "试映会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "480846d8b0346850366c9cf653c212d8c362c076b733de3f314fd6555e8f1350", "ja": "（試写を見たお客さんの反応は上々。\n映画の成功を感じさせるものとなった！）", "zh": "（看完试映的观众反响非常好。\n让人感受到了电影成功的希望！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "1531334f051bee682f1827b0b8288e43725397df6d308180beb16456ac3079dc", "ja": "お客さんたち、楽しんでくれたみたいですね。\nよかった……。", "zh": "客人们好像都看得很开心呢。\n太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "77f6198c69e9dc7708676cc4b3f3da58f168ac3444457161c82a008bcf6c3ac7", "ja": "そうだね。出演者の私でも、おかしくて\n吹き出しちゃうシーンが、たくさんあって……。", "zh": "是啊。就连作为出演者的我，也有好多场景觉得太有趣，忍不住笑了出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "f98e06d0e5f3c46d4be900073abe7f4e4fbb98dbb9d879d81f2109a8c51c93d0", "ja": "逆に、「みんな、そこで笑うんだ！？」って\n驚く場面もありましたね！", "zh": "反过来，也有一些场面让我惊讶地想：“大家居然会在那里笑！？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "e20bf3deaada2709544582f719b546c71a690f0c8b1d102de21cc2c5333ae0a0", "ja": "私も、不思議だった！　面白いって思うところって、\n人によって全然違うんだ～！って。", "zh": "我也觉得很不可思议！每个人觉得有趣的地方，完全不一样呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "9dac1e896951850f124d8f306095d0baa174dc9eb451509d0829f7044a5b9812", "ja": "そうね……だから、人を笑わせるって難しいのかも。\n勉強になったわ。", "zh": "是啊……所以，想逗别人笑也许并不容易。\n我学到了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "d9573de484ceff560f05d2bf0b39fa79f9f318d4edb4b3dac6ffe3928e08727d", "ja": "うん。挑戦してみてよかった。\n……ですよね？　{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯，挑战一下果然是对的。\n……是吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f25ea73a2371401e86fdf3e06be759c9ecb4f4ef7b4e190ab3d6bba99ac900d8", "ja": "そうだな。琴葉だけじゃなく、\nみんなよく頑張った。新境地が開けたと思う！", "zh": "是啊。不只是琴叶，\n大家都很努力。我觉得我们打开了新的境界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5eb813c47b44e49d2e0bfd192e4fc78390166e4c9f30d553cb527b7ebf49fe41", "ja": "新境地……たしかにそうかも。\nまた一緒にお芝居したいね、志保ちゃん♪", "zh": "新的境界……确实也许是这样。\n真想再一起演戏呢，志保♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "95e9cf704124a15db10ff3c10415fd231740ff1542236195fe1e507a5e1b3300", "ja": "えっ。私は、こういう役はもう……\nいえ、楽しくなかったわけじゃないですけど。", "zh": "咦。我已经不想再演这种角色了……\n不，也不是说演得不开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddc9aa57b555f7a25946a07bba4ab680c445703f8143482132a8baf22b7add3a", "ja": "私は、またやってみたいです！\nお願いしますね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我还想再试一次！拜托你了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "85f29e56c59335ee98b1a8b5cab189cdc7d7bd8388634b76c12f00959715f50e", "ja": "わかったわかった。\nでも、似たような仕事があるかなぁ……？", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n不过，不知道能不能接到类似的工作啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "54ef9174963cd73a76737568f2b011ff3d80e9c6e09b2cbe30c1b16fb351c7ca", "ja": "百合子さん……\n被害者役に、ずいぶんこだわりがあるんですね。", "zh": "百合子……\n你对被害者这个角色还真是执着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ed08bb0381e160096ea187f334c51210aa2f1e395111d22abc44c0ba39235e9", "ja": "それはもう！　古今東西、ミステリー作品の被害者には\nいろんなやられ方があるんだよ！", "zh": "那当然！古今中外，推理作品里的受害者都有各种各样的死法呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "825851a8038aac7abaa9000a7ff4de84b60332a6a5fb7117392336dc502f504c", "ja": "画的に映えるような死体も多くて、\nいつか私もあんなふうに……！", "zh": "还有很多死得很有画面感的尸体，总有一天我也要像那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ffdfcca9bcb3e5530b9db9d1654f16f67c74951aed4065152ab49a364918f4b", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ。\n被害者の世界って、奥が深いんだね……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊。\n被害者的世界还真是深奥呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "7309627955f756850dfc7d9cd69b46bae8ff161ee0e58c2e8997fbbd9607b868", "ja": "そうなんだ～。百合子の話を聞いたら、\nちょっとやってみたくなってきたかも……？", "zh": "这样啊～。听百合子讲完之后，我好像也有点想试试看了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b9210b0e2c9c2cd3299f2696d83433d7f9903840b481a5b6b4878b570a26bce7", "ja": "まあでも、あくまでアイドルだし……。\nあんまりな物は、そもそも画面に映せないと思うけど。", "zh": "不过话说回来，毕竟是偶像……。\n太不像样的东西，应该根本没法出现在画面上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "5facff6ad1df988ed52cac5a86a054c7776f449e0f683ccb72e36ddbc5852151", "ja": "ふふ……あ、そうだ、未来。\n漫才のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵……啊，对了，未来。\n关于漫才的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "51b1d02ba642514cabe97949023fbda3e83ccd78f733c2813d933f3d60013b16", "ja": "新しい台本を作ってきたから、\n読んで感想を聞かせてもらえる？", "zh": "我写了新的剧本，\n你能读一下告诉我感想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "759ac3d891177b04f01de7c112d7d89aee2dc394d11fea2fddd852bbec4d68b2", "ja": "えっ。まだやるつもりだったのか！？", "zh": "诶。你还打算继续做下去吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c26725dbb2826262b375a63d525ea866c4004bbad25ff62b82c473b7619b383", "ja": "わあ～。琴葉ちゃん、もう考えたの？\nすごいボリュームだね！", "zh": "哇～。琴叶，你已经想出来了吗？\n好厚的一叠啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "76b3db5728614a8f847a7d11ec11ad221731a336a8f8a42cdc224125b4b88058", "ja": "映画の台本みたいな厚さだね……\nこれ、本当に漫才……なのかな……？", "zh": "跟电影剧本一样厚呢……\n这个，真的是漫才……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "01f249b1cef8e70aea2d9de423ee0dadd64a878a076221907b3cfb2c7d07cacc", "ja": "私にも読ませてください！\n琴葉さん、力作ですね！", "zh": "也让我读读吧！琴叶，真是大作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "481f788f895bd429e6e73fe982cbf3906881dd5b7f2322c677b593266df91024", "ja": "つい、筆が乗っちゃって……。", "zh": "一不小心就越写越起劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "91c76e73ae490c8bdc6b8dcabe6f2b89e6f3d00f56ab905518daeed1fc4a6903", "ja": "ここまでくると、逆に見てみたいですね。\n面白いかどうかは別として。", "zh": "都到这个地步了，反而让人想看看呢。\n至于有不有趣，那就另说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "45c2421b14093b6cce0b57695c92f0a2c6bc2667e046e7b3b35ca0892ad1d83b", "ja": "でしょでしょ！？\nでも、こんなにたくさん覚えきれないよ～！？", "zh": "对吧对吧！？\n可是这么多，我可记不住啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "4cad61012ca75ab363201fb322cc665fa51877d4a81d6b930e3c4488d0414374", "ja": "まあ、急いで覚える必要もないし……\nゆっくり、な！", "zh": "嗯，也没必要急着记住……\n慢慢来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5a2e92ea228d9a65b0e20d20c1f3fb66028d6aceed3d98a403e796f624b34e53", "ja": "さて、そろそろ打ち上げの時間だ。", "zh": "好了，差不多该去庆功宴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "d09e990eb3258cf7973fe7aad23cd85ece9bbe3d24f5a35f05d99dead4ea9839", "ja": "待ってました～！　もうお腹ぺこぺこです♪\nお店のスイーツ、制覇しちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "等好久啦～！肚子早就饿得咕咕叫了♪\n我要把店里的甜点全吃个遍～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "34ba6e87406c2b320feeb5e78f0051dbc968219475a2e670718a5911e5c91063", "ja": "社長達と合流して、店に向かうとするか！", "zh": "跟社长他们汇合，然后去店里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "d25de254a40c4a52cc6cf90aeed37962f3f5d7cdc8e75bec98ae5be99e435849", "ja": "そうですね。\n社長の感想も、聞きたいですし。", "zh": "是啊。\n我也想听听社长的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "bd5ea8967acf64034016dfb69802c803547719013bd94aef9e34cbb1a7545eb8", "ja": "私も、聞きたいことがたくさんあって……！\n小鳥さん、なんて言ってくれるかなぁ？", "zh": "我也有好多想问的事情……！小鸟小姐会怎么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd6b42a63d9bd38f5ce46553b30672c61c3d32fafacd6b224055abe80b244c42", "ja": "みんな、話題に困ることはなさそうだね。\nむしろ時間が足りないかも……ふふっ。", "zh": "大家好像都不愁没话题聊呢。\n说不定反而会觉得时间不够……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "b75c53193ac238adf4dbd25ad4c5187932444886ba99fa5f90502bec68fe3520", "ja": "その時は、次の店をセッティングするよ。\nみんなで思う存分、語り合ってくれ！", "zh": "到时候，我来安排下一家店。\n大家尽情聊个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
